From: blester <blester@oreon>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] emit pandas UserWarnings mpl 3.10 / py3.14 still need

py3.14 warnings.warn stack walk skips extra frames so stacklevel from
find_stack_level can overshoot and the warning never records.
skip_file_prefixes on pandas dirs except tests. catch_warnings(action=)
applies always in the record context. mpl 3.10 get_figure(root=True).

diff --git a/pandas/_testing/_warnings.py b/pandas/_testing/_warnings.py
index c9a2879..b199076 100644
--- a/pandas/_testing/_warnings.py
+++ b/pandas/_testing/_warnings.py
@@ -92,8 +92,7 @@ def assert_produces_warning(
     """
     __tracebackhide__ = True
 
-    with warnings.catch_warnings(record=True) as w:
-        warnings.simplefilter(filter_level)
+    with warnings.catch_warnings(record=True, action=filter_level) as w:
         try:
             yield w
         finally:
